ttribution. Membership advancement is based on Le Manager's qualification rules and is not automatic from recruiting alone.</small></p></section><section class="lmh-dashboard" id="membership-tree"><div class="lmh-kicker">Each One Bring One · 7 Generations</div><h2>My Membership Tree</h2><p>Your tree starts with you and expands through the verified members connected to your network. Open any branch to explore the next generation.</p><div class="lmh-tree-stats"><div><strong><?php echo esc_html($ref_stats['direct_count']);?></strong><span>Direct</span></div><div><strong><?php echo esc_html($network['total_network']);?></strong><span>Total Network</span></div><?php for($g=1;$g<=7;$g++):?><div><strong><?php echo esc_html($network['by_depth'][$g]??0);?></strong><span>Gen <?php echo esc_html($g);?></span></div><?php endfor;?></div><div class="lmh-tree-root"><details open class="lmh-tree-self"><summary><span class="lmh-tree-avatar"><?php echo esc_html(strtoupper(substr($user->display_name,0,1)));?></span><span class="lmh-tree-person"><strong><?php echo esc_html($user->display_name);?></strong><small>LMID <?php echo esc_html(substr($identity['id'],0,3).' '.substr($identity['id'],3,3).' '.substr($identity['id'],6,3));?></small><span class="lmh-tree-level">LEVEL <?php echo esc_html($identity['level_number'].' · '.strtoupper(str_replace('_',' ',$identity['level'])));?></span><small>YOU · <?php echo esc_html($network['total_network']);?> total network</small></span></summary><?php
$render_member_tree=function($nodes,$generation=1) use (&$render_member_tree){
  if(empty($nodes)){echo '<p style="margin-left:24px"><small>No members in this branch yet.</small></p>';return;}
  echo '<div class="lmh-tree-generation" data-generation="'.esc_attr($generation).'">';
